---
title: "refund (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_guard: whenNotPaused AND whenSaleNotCanceled AND whenRefundPeriodNotOver
    q_guard --> q_get_pos: guards pass
    q_get_pos --> q_verify_exists: positionId = _getInvestorPositionId(msg.sender)
    q_verify_exists --> q_verify_refund: _verifyPositionExists(positionId)
    q_verify_refund --> q_cache: _verifyHasNotRefunded(positionId)
    q_cache --> q_zero_capital: amountToRefund = investedCapital
    q_zero_capital --> q_flag: investedCapital = 0
    q_flag --> q_decrement: hasRefunded = true
    q_decrement --> q_emit: totalCapitalInvested -= amountToRefund
    q_emit --> q_transfer: emit CapitalRefunded(amountToRefund, msg.sender, positionId)
    q_transfer --> [*]: safeTransfer(bidToken, msg.sender, amountToRefund)

    note right of q_zero_capital
        INV-001: full invested capital refunded (not partial)
        INV-002: investedCapital set to 0 before transfer (CEI pattern)
        INV-003: hasRefunded flag prevents double refund
        INV-004: refund only during active refund period (before refundEndTime)
    end note
